@startuml
title 选课系统用例模型 v0.1
left to right direction
actor 学生 as Student
actor 教务基础数据系统 as Registry
rectangle "选课系统 v0.1" {
  usecase "办理选课" as Enroll
  usecase "查看选课结果" as View
  usecase "校验学生资格" as CheckStudent
  usecase "校验课程状态" as CheckCourse
  usecase "校验重复选课" as CheckDuplicate
  usecase "校验容量并登记" as CheckCapacity
}
Student --> Enroll
Student --> View
Enroll .> CheckStudent : <<include>>
Enroll .> CheckCourse : <<include>>
Enroll .> CheckDuplicate : <<include>>
Enroll .> CheckCapacity : <<include>>
Registry --> CheckStudent
Registry --> CheckCourse
note bottom of Enroll
US-001 / UC-001
end note
note bottom of CheckCapacity
DEC-001 / BR-003
end note
@enduml
